    <innernamespace refid="namespacecuda_1_1experimental_1_1stf">cuda::experimental::stf</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Facilities to define the place affinity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Setting an affinity will help defining what is the default execution place. They are used in combination with loop_dispatch to dispatch computation over a set of execution places.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>loop_dispatch </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
